{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"scripts/smoke-comment-loop.sh","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T12:13:55.181124Z","id":"88a918ca41f429f3ced1487dc1d70ae2e4735d06e3a3d6c385870e323415b53b","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:3523c997","summary":"scripts/smoke-comment-loop.sh now expects 'Viewer (not connected):' and 'sent together by Viewer (not connected)', the decided wording (spec 9.6, section 19 item 7; record 7fdbaaf5). CLAX_TEST_BIN=<kept debug clax> scripts/smoke-comment-loop.sh: 'comment loop smoke passed', rc 0.","supersedes":"a22f9051e982ea41982304860f0d4e9e3e54114cf28b4242814e364f9789b4ed","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
