{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"scripts/check-wasm.sh","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-14T12:31:11.609615Z","id":"2769babff3f0e3dcdb4eb408f2235d135d1e1a0d06df544269dfa34476fcc571","body":{"kind":"resolve","summary":"Duplicate head left by a merge: this is a parallel branch's re-anchor of the record that cc73bc73ef882290fc0bb205fe711601ff240333e95e4015f1887bac77148e6a closed (Fixed: scripts/quality_gates.sh runs scripts/check-wasm.sh (clax-core, clax-rt, clax-mcp, clax-server) in its own wasm lane, which fails naming a missing LLVM o). That close stands in the merged code; this head carries no new content.","supersedes":"64a4871d2f683a706a40aa8e51412f80871cacd2c6d2c6dc92046f30566adce4","tags":["reason:duplicate","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
